(F5 T2 V4d: group_beam_memory -updated still selects the updated beam
 (the GNU default before 2026-11-02): the local axes follow the deformed
 chord. Same cantilever as group_beam_memory_default1: the tip vely 0.01
 rotates the chord by 0.01: force 0.2399880 instead of 0.24. The
 Professional 02-08-2026 stops on this input with
 "materi_displacement should not be initialised." (BEAM-MEMORY-UPDATED).)
echo -no
number_of_space_dimensions 3
materi_velocity
materi_displacement
beam_rotation
end_initia
node 1 0 0 0
node 2 1 0 0
element 1 -beam 1 2
group_type 0 -beam
group_beam_young 0 2
group_beam_shear 0 0.5
group_beam_inertia 0 1 4 1
group_beam_memory 0 -updated
bounda_dof 0 1 -velx -vely -velz -rotx -roty -rotz
bounda_dof 2 2 -velx -velz -rotx -roty
bounda_dof 1 2 -vely
bounda_time 1 0.01
control_timestep 0 1. 1.
end_data
